Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `show` uses the effect `FS.Read`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effects/trait_value_call_takes_union_of_impls.jet:10:28
    |
 10 | show: fn(source: Source) -[Net]> String { source.text() }
    |                            ^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[Net]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the effect list, or stop using it in `show`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: show
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
